            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze: “Naho ivyo womenga biratangaje ku masigarira y’aba bantu muri iki gihe, mbega no kuri jewe vyoba ibitangaje?” ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
