            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imbuto zizokura neza, umuzabibu uzokwama ivyamwa vyawo, isi izotuma haba ivyimburwa, n’amajuru azozana ikime cayo. Ivyo vyose nzobiha amasigarira y’aba bantu ngo bibe umwandu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’uko mwebwe, Abayuda n’Abisirayeli, mwabaye umuvumo mu mahanga, ni ko nzobakiza, kandi muzoba umugisha. Ntimutinye, ahubwo amaboko yanyu nakomere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
